Comment: 0,0:00:52.61,0:01:02.79,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}The faint light of night runs with blood, wandering screams beg before visions
Comment: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:11.89,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Flickering flames grow in the rear of your mind, toward the place that awakens your soul...
Comment: 0,0:01:12.10,0:01:15.49,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Knowing not even the meaning of their birth in this world,
Comment: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:21.77,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}the travelers know only the bounds of this dark night
Comment: 0,0:01:22.01,0:01:32.07,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}In the hour of crossing the grieving river, the scenery will be frozen as violet
Comment: 0,0:01:32.29,0:01:42.44,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Even if you lose all desire, your prayers can still be grasped
Comment: 0,0:01:42.60,0:01:52.29,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}The judged believers scream out, those gathered who rebel are but darkness
Comment: 0,0:01:52.52,0:02:02.79,translation A,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Along with the profound pain of the driven stakes, repentance fades into legend
Comment: 0,0:02:02.79,0:02:07.22,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}A trap of falsehoods, a shadow of black now erased,
Comment: 0,0:02:07.38,0:02:12.91,translation B,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}it is the hour of the fall, of scattered ruin
